  {
   "key": "func CollectorSessionControl.discardPausedRecording()",
   "hash": "b1e7a87c1354e332",
   "does": "Discards the paused night: for the paused session and each paused ancestor in its chain (pausedChain), newest first, deletes it from the archive and only then removes its raw RR backup and iCloud live backup; then resetSession (which also clears the persisted pause keys) and notifies archive observers. When a delete throws it stops there (that segment and older ones keep their backups, no resetSession) and hands over to keepPauseAfterFailedDelete, which leaves or re-enters the pause and sets lastError. The strap is not touched.",
   "entry": "Through RRCollector.discardPausedRecording() from the Record screen's paused-state Discard confirmation (RecordView.discardPausedNight()).",
   "calls": [
    "Emuqu/Sources/Utilities/DebugLog.swift::func debugLog(_:level:file:line:)",
