   "key": "func CollectorSessionControl.discardDeviceRecording()",
   "hash": "55f15cd6b5984fcb",
   "does": "Discards a strap-only recording: while a night's ending is in progress (StreamingLifecycle.isEndingOvernight) logs and returns false touching nothing; while a workout is live (the strap's recording is its backup) logs, sets lastError alreadyRecording and returns false touching nothing; otherwise logs, asks PolarManager.discardStoredExercises (stops a running strap recording and removes every stored one). On failure logs a warning, sets lastError and returns false leaving the session and its backups as they were. On success removes the session's raw RR backup and iCloud live backup, clears the persisted recording record, resetSession and returns true.",
